330 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (This project analyzes the information architecture \(IA\) of the Ninja app, which is designed to make grocery delivery fast and easy. As people rely more on mobile apps for daily tasks having clear and organized information is very important. The focus is on how products are shown grouped searched for, and how the checkout process works. The goal is to find areas for improvement and suggest ways to make the user experience smoother and more efficient.)
/E (This project analyzes the information architecture \(IA\) of the Ninja app, which is designed to make grocery delivery fast and easy. As people rely more on mobile apps for daily tasks having clear and organized information is very important. The focus is on how products are shown grouped searched for, and how the checkout process works. The goal is to find areas for improvement and suggest ways to make the user experience smoother and more efficient.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
