<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (This project gave a full review of how the Ninja grocery app is organized. We looked at important parts like how products are grouped, how the search works, and how users pay for their orders. We found things the app does well and other things that can be better. A good app structure helps users have an easy and happy experience, especially in fast services like grocery delivery. Our ideas and suggestions can help make the app easier to use, better to move around in, and more enjoyable. This project shows how important it is to design apps that focus on what users need to make digital services successful.)
/E (This project gave a full review of how the Ninja grocery app is organized. We looked at important parts like how products are grouped, how the search works, and how users pay for their orders. We found things the app does well and other things that can be better. A good app structure helps users have an easy and happy experience, especially in fast services like grocery delivery. Our ideas and suggestions can help make the app easier to use, better to move around in, and more enjoyable. This project shows how important it is to design apps that focus on what users need to make digital services successful.)
/Pg 53 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
